    "description": "<p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Once per Round, you can use an Action or skip your Move to spend a Studied die and issue a command. When you do, roll the Studied die to determine the bonus granted from the command, which lasts until the start of your next Turn.</span></p><p><br></p><p><b><strong style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Attack:</strong></b><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"> Your Allies can add this bonus to Checks Targeting an Enemy. If the Check would have passed without your bonus, it is added to the damage dealt instead.</span></p><p><br></p><p><b><strong style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Defend:</strong></b><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"> Your Allies can add this bonus to Reflex Saves. If the Save fails, they gain the die as Armor against the Action instead.</span></p>",
